<%# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    THE COUNTDOWN. Real engine timers, narrative only -- nothing here can fail
    the mission. delayMs is real time; the fiction is 30 minutes, the clock is
    60, so one fictional minute is two real ones.
      T-30 briefing               0 min   (briefing ink, not a timer)
      T-20 architect_t20_played  20 min
      T-10 architect_t10_played  40 min   AND redirect_window_closed
      T-5  architect_t5_played   50 min
      T-1  architect_t1_played   58 min
      T-0  countdown_expired     60 min   (pressure only; grid_saved is unaffected)
    All six start on `team_assigned` so the clock begins when the player has
    actually made the delegation call, and all six are cancelled by `grid_saved`
    so a finished mission stops shouting. WP2 must ALSO set
    redirect_window_closed from flag3_submitted -- the progress gate is the
    guarantee that the window closes even for a very fast run.
%>
